    family-names: Bodner
    affiliation: "Department of Radiation Oncology, Tirol Kliniken"
  - given-names: U.
    family-names: Ganswindt
    affiliation: "Department of Radiation Oncology, Medical University of Innsbruck"
  - given-names: S.
    family-names: Kollotzek
    affiliation: "Department of Radiation Oncology, Medical University of Innsbruck"
  # Further contributors are listed in CONTRIBUTORS.md.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AG-Kollotzek/surf-etds-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Evaluation pipeline for the tracking accuracy of a surface-guided radiotherapy
  system (ExacTrac Dynamic Surface) against a motorised 3-DOF phantom, the SURF
  Test Unit: synchronisation of the two logs, calibrated forward kinematics with
  uncertainty propagation, metrics over six degrees of freedom, statistics and
  figures, and an independent radiographic check of the kinematic model.
keywords:
  - radiotherapy
  - surface-guided radiotherapy
  - SGRT
  - quality assurance
  - tracking accuracy
  - medical physics
# The code is MIT; the documentation and the result tables are CC-BY-4.0, as set out under license-url.
license: MIT
